  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 528dcf3a-384f-4c6e-bc3a-a60c35916e8d
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • November 2024 achieved highest sales at $118,447.83
        • December 2023 reached $96,999.04 in sales
        • Q4 months consistently show stronger performance than other quarters
        • General upward trend observed across 48 months from 2021-2024

        Recommendations:
        • Capitalize on Q4 momentum by increasing inventory and marketing spend during October-December
        • Analyze November 2024 success factors to replicate in other months
        • Focus growth strategies on historically weaker Q1-Q3 periods
